{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your pet shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have quite a large land to build your pet shop. You can build your shop on this land according to your pleasure, build shelters for large dogs, do landscaping and place cute decoration objects to attract the attention of your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/8c7b5824d52fa1d645da0a425dda57fd.poster.avif?t=1760516489\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/8c7b5824d52fa1d645da0a425dda57fd.webm?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/8c7b5824d52fa1d645da0a425dda57fd.mp4?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/858c61deb0e0951a1f8199a72491f518.poster.avif?t=1760516489\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/858c61deb0e0951a1f8199a72491f518.webm?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/858c61deb0e0951a1f8199a72491f518.mp4?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take care of your animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the animals and watch them grow. Breeding animals will now be much more enjoyable. While breeding animals that are suitable for breeding, you can also discover new and more valuable species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/17d42219077513199069454beac2e629.poster.avif?t=1760516489\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/17d42219077513199069454beac2e629.webm?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/17d42219077513199069454beac2e629.mp4?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many animal species</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, which has a very wide animal catalogue, you will be able to feed, breed and find them a family, exotic fish, reptiles, birds, arthropods, as well as cute cats and dogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/f15b9712f77149380b2c9ca68a5fa031.poster.avif?t=1760516489\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/f15b9712f77149380b2c9ca68a5fa031.webm?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/f15b9712f77149380b2c9ca68a5fa031.mp4?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/301388b8a7ef8d93849e5c34e91ca239.poster.avif?t=1760516489\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/301388b8a7ef8d93849e5c34e91ca239.webm?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/301388b8a7ef8d93849e5c34e91ca239.mp4?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customer satisfaction is important</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy customers leave positive reviews and increase the shop's reputation. Your shop reputation increases the number of customers and you can bring more animal lovers together with our cute animal friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/6c375ef0f34c7b10c078aec28659fe47.poster.avif?t=1760516489\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/6c375ef0f34c7b10c078aec28659fe47.webm?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/6c375ef0f34c7b10c078aec28659fe47.mp4?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your pet shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your shop grows and your number of animals increases, you'll need help. You can hire employees for this. Employees can work as shop cleaning, depot control, animal care and cashiers, reducing your workload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/35a0f0152fbb76626f9716fe53b4099b.poster.avif?t=1760516489\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824380/extras/35a0f0152fbb76626f9716fe53b4099b.webm?t=1760516489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><